OL,3,GNEWSAThe three walking dads vow to save
OL,4,Asuicide helpline
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father whose teenage daughter took
OL,7,Fher own life said he would campaign to
OL,8,Freinstate a "life-saving" helpline
OL,9,Fafter a suicide prevention charity
OL,10,Ffolded.
OL,12,FTim Owen, who lost 19-year-old Emily in
OL,13,F2020, has trekked the length and
OL,14,Fbreadth of the UK as one of 3 Dads
OL,15,FWalking, all of whom have lost a
OL,16,Fdaughter to suicide.
OL,18,FThey have raised #1.5m for the Papyrus
OL,19,Femergency helpline, which earlier this
OL,20,Fweek announced it had entered
OL,21,Fadministration.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
